WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.292
[Orchestral fanfare] Decapod Labs presents.

00:00:03.292 --> 00:00:05.792
Humble beginnings in a small seaside starter home and Mira’s modest cottage.

00:00:05.792 --> 00:00:08.292
Clack mines a copper seam underground.

00:00:08.292 --> 00:00:11.375
Clack leaps and brings a charged sword down in a pounce.

00:00:11.375 --> 00:00:13.375
A bow shot cuts through an early mine fight.

00:00:13.375 --> 00:00:16.333
Carrying the starter Kelp Lantern, Clack enters the Staff Shop and emerges with the Sunclaw Scepter.

00:00:16.333 --> 00:00:18.333
Clack jumps above a swarm of monsters and casts Tidehex.

00:00:18.333 --> 00:00:21.792
The starter home rises into a palace with ornate furnishings and a canopy bed; Mira’s home gains a new rug and a glowing orrery.

00:00:21.792 --> 00:00:23.292
Clack fights in the neighborhood Pearl Ring.

00:00:23.292 --> 00:00:27.958
[Music swells] The ring becomes the Imperial Dome. Clack wins and the crowd throws gold.

00:00:27.958 --> 00:00:30.000
Clack. code with the crabs. Powered by Decapod Labs.
